<urn:atm:triage:finding/AZS4-QA-011>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AZS4-QA-011" ;
  triage:title "Unbounded run_blocking helper in herdr_queue_wake.rs has no timeout wrapper across 6+ call sites" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr's formal QA-2 verdict (rust-service-hardening-agent, RSH-003) reports that herdr_queue_wake.rs's own run_blocking helper (crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake.rs:1028, distinct from the scheduler's already-fixed helper closed under AZS4-QA-008/RSH-001) wraps tokio::task::spawn_blocking with no timeout across 6+ call sites: pending-store reads (line 227), candidate reads (line 248), claim/release (line 723), escalation dispatch (line 786), escalation mail (line 861), and roster reads (line 891) -- all awaited inside the single sequential pump task, so a blocking-store stall at any one call site would hang the whole pump silently with no bound. REOPENED 2026-09-10T16:34:10Z: cipher's fix (e8c2dafd6, wrapping the shared run_blocking helper in tokio::time::timeout(HERDR_REQUEST_DEADLINE, ...)) correctly bounds all 6 original call sites -- confirmed by quality-mgr's QA-3 pass. However QA-3's rust-service-hardening-agent found, and quality-mgr independently confirmed via git-show at 34c6d256c, a 7th unbounded path: ReleasePendingOnDrop::release_in_drop (crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake_claim.rs:117-148, invoked from Drop::drop at line 158) spawns the claim release/requeue job via tokio::runtime::Handle::spawn_blocking directly -- never through the shared run_blocking helper -- so it has no HERDR_REQUEST_DEADLINE bound (Drop can't .await the async wrapper). The resulting JoinHandle is joined by await_release_handles with no timeout either, so a stuck store call hangs unbounded and can block pump shutdown." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-az" ;
  triage:triageMode "followup_pass" ;
  triage:category "reliability" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake.rs, crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake_claim.rs" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:closedAt "2026-09-10T17:10:35Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-10T16:20:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:foundIn triage:AZ.4 ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-09-10T16:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
